              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "സിംഹാസനം (siṁhāsanaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit siṁhāsana, \"a lion's seat, a king's seat, a throne\" (Monier-Williams), from siṁha, \"a lion\" (CDIAL 13384), and āsana, \"a seat\" (CDIAL 1484)."
            }
